Id: php003i
Severity: INFO
Category: services
Check: check_php
Fix: Set display_errors = Off and log_errors = On in php.ini.
References: php.ini directives
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST SI-11; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

PHP shows its errors to visitors, with the paths behind them. Log
them instead (log_errors) and show users a page of your own.
